  "summary": "AC-022 through AC-025 implemented in one Task Group. Eight direct defaults and exact field-only scope retain the unchanged checked kernel and conversion owner. Baseline passed before production changes; final clean gate passed 1084 tests. Explicit default types resolve Scala Nothing inference. Compiler classpath strengthened to exclude aggregate effects. Scope/example compiler tests passed, including a retained Price.exact(instrument) function. Review found no actionable issues. JDK 26.0.2.1 host targeted release 25, not a JDK 25 execution claim. Short JMH allocations varied by fork; three-fork follow-up gave direct 752.049 +/-15.650 ns and 4349.342 +/-16.693 B/op versus scope 747.364 +/-12.980 ns and 4274.675 +/-133.542 B/op, overlapping intervals. Measurements are indicative, not deterministic performance guarantees. Canonical whole-change Verify and human gates remain pending."
